We need a strategy, and that is...

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.210
What?! I'm not going in?

00:23:47.350 --> 00:23:51.210
What is this? Why am I here, then?

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:55.780
Next time on Beyblade Burst! 
"Mega Flames! Double Impact!!”

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.610
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.780 --> 00:23:59.500
